# Summary

Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter.[[cite:obs-2c958c9addcedf457d53bd8bc614f38105a7d418 "Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter."]]

Ordinary contributions: one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January.[[cite:obs-01c04fc65930d3f8d2226fb5fd32ad3133c36bff "Ordinary contributions: one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January."]]
